OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FLuigi Mangione has admitted to fatally
OL,7,Fshooting UnitedHealthcare CEO Brian
OL,8,FThompson, telling a federal court: "I
OL,9,Fshot him."
OL,11,FMangione made the confession during a
OL,12,Ffederal court hearing in Manhattan on
OL,13,FFriday, where he pleaded guilty to
OL,14,Ffederal stalking charges in the
OL,15,Fkilling of Mr Thompson.
OL,17,FThe federal charges accuse Mangione of
OL,18,Fstalking Thompson to cause his death.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
