OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FMangione's guilty plea resolves one of
OL,7,Ftwo cases against him in connection
OL,8,Fwith Mr Thompson's death.
OL,10,FHe is still due to stand trial for
OL,11,Fstate murder charges on September 8,
OL,12,Fwhich he has pleaded not guilty to.
OL,14,FWhen reading out his statement in
OL,15,Fcourt, the 28-year-old said: "I shot
OL,16,FMr Thompson and he died.
OL,18,F"I knew what I was doing was illegal."
OL,26,@wD@^OUzD@AOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
