OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FWith his guilty plea in federal court,
OL,7,Fhis lawyers could seek to have the
OL,8,Fstate case thrown out on double
OL,9,Fjeopardy grounds.
OL,11,FMangione's defence lawyer, Karen
OL,12,FFriedman, said outside court: "Mr
OL,13,FMangione has accepted full
OL,14,Fresponsibility for the death of Brian
OL,15,FThompson."
OL,17,FShe argued her client shouldn't face
OL,18,Ftwo prosecutions over a "single tragic
OL,19,Fevent".
OL,26,@tD@_OUzD@YOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
