OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FMangione told the court that "after
OL,7,Fyears of enduring pain from a broken
OL,8,Fback" and witnessing similar
OL,9,Fexperiences of others, he said he
OL,10,Flearned UnitedHealthcare would be
OL,11,Fholding its annual investor conference
OL,12,Fin December 2024.
OL,14,FThe defendant said the public location
OL,15,Fwasn't posted, but he researched to
OL,16,Flearn the location and who would be
OL,17,Fthere.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
