OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,F"In November of 2024 I travelled from
OL,7,Foutside of New York state to
OL,8,FManhattan. I then emailed
OL,9,FUnitedHealthcare leadership, posing as
OL,10,Fan investor at a firm managing over
OL,11,F$15 billion (#11 billion) in assets
OL,12,Fand requesting information about the
OL,13,Fconference. Unlike my previous
OL,14,Finteractions with insurers, I received
OL,15,Fan immediate response within an hour,"
OL,16,FMangione said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
