OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FMangione was charged by both federal
OL,7,Fand state prosecutors with ambushing
OL,8,FMr Thompson, 50, outside a New York
OL,9,FCity hotel on December 4 2024, as the
OL,10,Finsurance executive walked to his
OL,11,Fcompany's annual investor conference.
OL,13,FSurveillance video of the killing
OL,14,Fshowed a masked gunman shooting Mr
OL,15,FThompson from behind.
OL,17,FPolice said "delay", "deny", and
OL,18,F"depose" were written on the
OL,19,Fammunition, mimicking a phrase used to
OL,20,Fdescribe how insurers avoid paying
OL,21,Fclaims.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FThere were also revelations that
OL,7,FMangione's private writings lambasted
OL,8,Fhealth insurers as greedy, according
OL,9,Fto authorities.
OL,11,FMangione, a University of Pennsylvania
OL,12,Fgraduate from a wealthy Maryland
OL,13,Ffamily, was never a UnitedHealthcare
OL,14,Fcustomer, according to police and the
OL,15,Fcompany.
OL,17,FHe was arrested five days after the
OL,18,Fshooting, when he was spotted at a
OL,19,FMcDonald's in Altoona, Pennsylvania.
OL,20,FIt's about 230 miles (370 kilometres)
OL,21,Fwest of Manhattan.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FMr Thompson, meanwhile, led one of the
OL,7,FUnited States' largest health
OL,8,Finsurers, but he wasn't well known
OL,9,Foutside the industry.
OL,11,FTrained as an accountant, he had
OL,12,Fworked at parent company UnitedHealth
OL,13,FGroup Inc for 20 years and became CEO
OL,14,Fof its insurance arm,
OL,15,FUnitedHealthcare, in 2021.
OL,17,FA trial on state murder charges is
OL,18,Fscheduled to start next month. It is
OL,19,Funclear whether that trial will go
OL,20,Fforward following Mangione's guilty
OL,21,Fplea in the federal case.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FBoth the federal and state cases could
OL,7,Flead to a life prison sentence. A
OL,8,Ffederal judge earlier this year tossed
OL,9,Fout additional charges that could have
OL,10,Fexposed Mangione to a potential death
OL,11,Fpenalty.
OL,13,FMangione had complained about the
OL,14,Fprospect of two trials, telling a
OL,15,Fjudge in February: "It's the same
OL,16,Ftrial twice. One plus one is two.
OL,17,FDouble jeopardy by any commonsense
OL,18,Fdefinition."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FUnder New York law, a state
OL,7,Fprosecution could potentially be
OL,8,Fbarred if the federal case is resolved
OL,9,Ffirst.
OL,11,FThe state's double jeopardy
OL,12,Fprotections kick in if a jury has been
OL,13,Fsworn in a prior prosecution, such as
OL,14,Fa federal case, or if that prosecution
OL,15,Fends in a guilty plea.
OL,17,FMangione's cases involve different
OL,18,Fcharges arising from the same course
OL,19,Fof conduct.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
