OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FIn a letter last month, state
OL,7,Fprosecutors objected to the
OL,8,Fpossibility of a guilty plea in the
OL,9,Ffederal case wiping out the state case.
