OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FUS District Judge Margaret M Garnett
OL,7,Fhas delivered some setbacks to the
OL,8,Fdefence, including ruling in January
OL,9,Fthat prosecutors could use items
OL,10,Fcollected from Mangione's backpack
OL,11,Fduring his arrest as evidence against
OL,12,Fhim.
OL,14,FThey included a 3D-printed pistol that
OL,15,Finvestigators said matched the one
OL,16,Fused to kill Thompson and a notebook
OL,17,Fin which authorities say Mangione
OL,18,Fdescribed his intent to kill an
OL,19,Finsurance executive.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786731513
OL,3,C'I shot him': Luigi Mangione admits
OL,4,Ckilling US healthcare boss
OL,6,FIn June, Mangione's lawyers said they
OL,7,Fwould pursue a psychiatric defence in
OL,8,Fthe state case but went back on this
OL,9,Fdecision a day later.
OL,11,FThe defence, involving claims that he
OL,12,Fwas suffering from extreme emotional
OL,13,Fdisturbance at the time of the
OL,14,Fkilling, isn't allowed in federal
OL,15,Fcourt.
OL,17,FHis sentencing has been scheduled for
OL,18,FDecember 18.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
